IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Buongiorno! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}O forse {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}buonanotte?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mmmh, difficile a dirsi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},
